    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Central is thrilled to launch to the market No. 2 Hogan Square, Hogan Place. Positioned in the heart of Dublin 2 within walking distance to Grand Canal Dock and Dublin city centre this fine 2 bedroom own door apartment comes to the market in impeccable condition. It is positioned very privately down a set off stairs to basement level. There is a private patio area to the front and the property has its own front door. Upon entry there a bright, spacious and welcoming hallway with a custom built seating area with clever storage, a storage cupboard and hot press. There is modern wooden flooring throughout creating a warm and homely feel. \nThere are two double bedrooms both of which have built in wardrobes, a main bathroom tiled for easy maintaince and an open plan fully equippped fitted kitchen and living room. \n\nThe apartment extends to c. 60 sq.m and is finished to a very high finish throughout. It includes one designated parking space in the underground car park. \n\nAdding to its appeal, the apartment includes a designated underground car space along with secure outdoor areas for bicycles, bins and general storage. Presented in turn-key condition and ready for immediate occupation, it is an excellent opportunity for investors, first-time buyers or those seeking a stylish Dublin base within walking distance of the city's major amenities. Located at the corner of Grattan Street and Grand Canal Street Lower, the apartment is just 1 km from St Stephen's Green and enjoys unparalleled access to cafés, restaurants, transport links, Grand Canal Dock, Merrion Square, Trinity College and the wider south city centre. Offering a blend of period elegance, modern luxury and exceptional convenience, this is a superb high-end apartment in a prime urban location."
      },
